## The four feature cards. The ids are built in code: landing-feature-<key>-title and
## landing-feature-<key>-description.

landing-feature-sessions-title = Opaque sessions
landing-feature-sessions-description = HttpOnly cookies backed by Postgres, with idle and absolute expiry. Only a hash of each token is stored.
landing-feature-passwords-title = Argon2id passwords
landing-feature-passwords-description = Rate-limited sign-in that answers the same, in the same time, whether or not an account exists.
landing-feature-email-title = Email verification and reset
landing-feature-email-description = Single-use, short-lived links by email. Resetting signs out every device.
landing-feature-roles-title = Roles and permissions
landing-feature-roles-description = RBAC with ownership rules, enforced in the application layer so no endpoint can forget the check.
